        "original_id": "8b4e2548-fb87-569f-b407-32f7a395e283",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Geet, The Song\n- People: Nirmala Devi, Shahu Modak, Aamir Ali, Shakir Ali, Chandabai, Govinda\n- Topics: Bollywood films, Indian film actors, Hindustani classical music, Patiala Gharana\n\nFacts:\n- Geet, also known as The Song, is a 1944 Bollywood film.\n- Geet starred Shahu Modak, Nirmala Devi, Aamir Ali, Shakir Ali, and Chandabai.\n- Nirmala Devi, also known as Nirmala Arun, was an Indian film actress in the 1940s and a Hindustani classical vocalist of the Patiala Gharana.\n- Nirmala Devi died in 1996.\n- Nirmala Devi was the mother of Bollywood actor Govinda.",
